    title: "Beamrider",
    developer: Some("Cheshire Engineering"),
    description: Some("Activision\'s fast futuristic shooter, developed by Cheshire Engineering. Your Beamrider ship skims a grid of light beams above Earth, clearing 99 sectors of an alien shield one at a time: sweep left and right to shoot fifteen enemy craft per sector with your laser lariat, spend your three torpedoes on the armoured ones, and dodge the rest. Clear a sector and a Sentinel ship streaks past for bonus points. Grab the yellow Rejuvenators for extra lives — but shoot one and it turns to deadly debris."),
